================================================================================
MODEL 1: BASELINE (OLS, No Fixed Effects)
================================================================================

Baseline Results (H1-H4):
  H1 (Immediate Disclosure):   0.7498% (p = 0.4776)
  H2 (FCC Status):            -2.2530% (p = 0.1713)
